# The sdist carried the whole test suite — 129 files, and the reason the archive was 659 KB against
# the wheel's 245 KB (M135). The wheel never had them (`[tool.setuptools] packages` names only
# `klarpdf`), so this only trims the source archive. Tests belong in the repo, which the sdist's
# metadata points at; nobody installing from PyPI runs them from there.
prune tests
prune packaging
prune vendor
exclude report.json
